  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 15866564608
    m_Localized: SKIP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 457306457804800
    m_Localized: "Text Localization Loading\u2026\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 479958182432768
    m_Localized: This is a super exciting plot I have carefully planned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 479992747692032
    m_Localized: ' You must watch it to the end'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480007570362368
    m_Localized: If you even skip the plot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480015640203264
    m_Localized: why don't you skip your own life?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 522551217917952
    m_Localized: Game Designer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3818279159762944
    m_Localized: 'Tip: Due to the lack of optimization during development, please
      restart the game at regular intervals to free up memory.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4022800360181760
    m_Localized: '!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4022820232794112
    m_Localized: Wait. Aren't I a hero?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4022850737967104
    m_Localized: How could I be a disabled person?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4119057107816448
    m_Localized: In order to make players to experience the satisfaction of growth
      during their adventure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4119745300828160
    m_Localized: "we\u2019ve integrated many basic functions into a skill tree"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4119763449581568
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ll need to earn skill points and unlock them gradually"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4119776556781568
    m_Localized: Just slightly push D forward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4133247046422528
    m_Localized: 'Toilet

      Village'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4177474128220160
    m_Localized: The toilet in my home is clogged
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4177554067460096
    m_Localized: Could you help me unclog it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4177577844969472
    m_Localized: You are more healthy than me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4177595557515264
    m_Localized: ' Why don''t you do it yourself?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4364113584623616
    m_Localized: .
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4196950953463808
    m_Localized: just help me out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4196965507698688
    m_Localized: Helping NPCs unclog toilets is the fundamental logic of this canned
      game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4196974961659904
    m_Localized: "don\u2019t ruin the game\u2019s worldview!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4196985363533824
    m_Localized: But
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4196994884603904
    m_Localized: "the game\u2019s worldview is about the demon king trying to wipe
      out humanity"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4197008688058368
    m_Localized: "why am I so free that I\u2019m stuck unclogging a toilet for you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4197602958020608
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4382353526394880
    m_Localized: This is part of the main storyline. If you don't do it, you can't
      progress
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4382401731530752
    m_Localized: Just open your map and take a look
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4382418106093568
    m_Localized: there are still 114514 question marks on it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4382439606095872
    m_Localized: which means you'll have to unclog 114514 more toilets later
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4382457884872704
    m_Localized: How about it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4382471751241728
    m_Localized: Enjoy the massive amount of exciting content we've prepared for
      you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4382488784310272
    m_Localized: Now, go check out the toilet ahead
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4441924542435328
    m_Localized: Isn't this the shit mountain code written by our team's programmer?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4441938543022080
    m_Localized: Why is it all here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4441953529270272
    m_Localized: The bugs are charging at you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4441967278198784
    m_Localized: quick, hit them with the toilet plunger!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4768301586092032
    m_Localized: ' This is not exactly the same as the me in the video just now'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4768667379732480
    m_Localized: but at least it can be said to be completely different
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4769494790082560
    m_Localized: And what the hell is this toilet peg in my hand?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4769748063129600
    m_Localized: Where is my horse?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4769910424637440
    m_Localized: Where is my sword?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4778733709332480
    m_Localized: Go for it! bro, Bottoms up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4804296037666816
    m_Localized: Oh no, although you've cleared the bug
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4804339121557504
    m_Localized: the program can't run at all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4804408168189952
    m_Localized: This game is going to crash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4804475776176128
    m_Localized: See you later
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5026284601643008
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
